        <mxCell id="CnyTc_cmp-E1sZ_Ip6yX-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;perimeterSpacing=1;strokeColor=default;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingTop=2;spacingRight=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingLeft=2;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontFamily=Cinzel;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DCinzel;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Cinzel&quot;&gt;Selynthar&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Cinzel&quot;&gt;God herself. Fought against &lt;b&gt;The Hand That Takes&lt;/b&gt; in the &lt;b&gt;War Above&lt;/b&gt;, eventually descending into the &lt;b&gt;Gray World&lt;/b&gt; and performing &lt;b&gt;Secarsion&lt;/b&gt; to seal The Hand That Takes into the &lt;b&gt;Godscar&lt;/b&gt; and bring life to &lt;b&gt;Eclipsia&lt;/b&gt;. Created the &lt;b&gt;Birthlights&lt;/b&gt; and the &lt;b&gt;Veilborn&lt;/b&gt;, lives in &lt;b&gt;Seraph-Elyon&lt;/b&gt; and is trapped outside by the &lt;b&gt;Sin Cloud&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="188" x="-20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
