        <mxCell id="vESyuJhb2s0FRK3e8iiK-26" parent="1" style="text;html=1;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;perimeterSpacing=1;strokeColor=default;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingTop=2;spacingRight=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingLeft=2;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontFamily=Cinzel;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DCinzel;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Rosary&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;One of the &lt;b&gt;Four Great Knights&lt;/b&gt;. She fled into the &lt;b&gt;Gray World&lt;/b&gt; during the &lt;b&gt;Rupture&lt;/b&gt; before the &lt;b&gt;Lust War&lt;/b&gt;, knowing that it was a battle she could never win. She only returns after the death of &lt;b&gt;the Veiled One&lt;/b&gt;, able to see through deception and maintaining loyalty with some doubt to &lt;b&gt;Selynthar&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
